@startuml
title Meshtastic Module Class Relationships

class MeshModule {
  +handleReceived(mp)
  +wantPacket(p)
}

class SinglePortModule {
  -ourPortNum
  +wantPacket(p)
}

class "concurrency::OSThread" as OSThread {
  +runOnce()
  +setIntervalFromNow()
}

class BitChatBridgeModule {
  +handleReceived(mp)
  +runOnce()
  -parseBitChatMessage()
  -createMeshPacket()
  -createPeerAnnouncement()
}

class Router {
  +allocForSending()
}

class MeshService {
  +sendToMesh(packet)
}

MeshModule <|-- SinglePortModule
SinglePortModule <|-- BitChatBridgeModule
OSThread <|-- BitChatBridgeModule

BitChatBridgeModule --> Router : alloc packet
BitChatBridgeModule --> MeshService : relay to mesh

note right of BitChatBridgeModule
  BitChatBridgeModule handles:
  - BLE <-> Mesh relay
  - duplicate suppression
  - TTL clamping/decrement
  - UTF-8-safe nickname truncation
end note

@enduml
